==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-B Vol. 3 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Mega Latios ex Drop Event]], which ran from January 17 to February 3, 2026.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Silver Tempest|Hawlucha|98}} from the {{TCG|Silver Tempest}} expansion.
*{{m|Aerial Ace}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Hawlucha}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

